---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import InnerTeaser from "../components/InnerTeaser.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About · Huaming"
  description="Shanghai Huaming Power Equipment makes tap changers for power transformers. Standard lead time about 4–6 weeks. International mail goes to Singapore."
>
  <main id="main" class="hm-list hm-about">
    <div class="hm-wrap hm-list-intro">
      <p class="hm-kicker">About</p>
      <h1>Why buyers choose Huaming</h1>
      <p class="hm-list-lede">
        Full range. A standing export desk in Singapore. A factory that has been in Putuo since 1989.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="hm-wrap hm-why" aria-label="Why Huaming">
      <article>
        <p class="hm-why-n">4–6 weeks</p>
        <p>Standard lead time. Shorter on inquiry.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="hm-why-n">150+</p>
        <p>Countries with Huaming tap changers, from the chairman letter.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="hm-why-n">CNAS</p>
        <p>Laboratory accreditation, 2009. Public pages list ISO 9001, 14001, and 18001.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <div class="hm-wrap hm-about-company">
      <div>
        <h2>The company</h2>
        <p>
          Shanghai Huaming Power Equipment Co., Ltd. Factory at No. 977 Tongpu Road, Putuo. Listed
          Shenzhen 002270.SZ in 2015. International headquarters: Huaming Power Equipment Singapore
          Pte. Ltd, Tai Seng Exchange, 1 Tai Seng Ave. Opened 29 April 2025. International mail:{" "}
          <a href="mailto:intl@huaming.com">intl@huaming.com</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Xiao Yi (肖毅) has been general manager since 1995. Türkiye plant 2016. Brazil and USA
          outlets 2019. Indonesia plant 2025. CHVT at Longdong ±800 kV HVDC, commissioned 28 May 2025.
        </p>
        <p class="hm-about-write"><a href="/contact/">Write Singapore</a></p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <img
          src="/images/00_HuaMing/about/chariman-raw.png"
          alt="Xiao Yi. General manager since 1995."
          width="536"
          height="468"
        />
        <figcaption>Xiao Yi. General manager since 1995.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <InnerTeaser />
  </main>
</Base>
